OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FA brighter, fresher-feeling
OL,6,Fday for many, with some warm sunny
OL,7,Fspells and a northwesterly wind.
OL,8,FCloudier at times in the west, with
OL,9,Fisolated showers possible.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FA
OL,12,Fchangeable period, with nearer-normal
OL,13,Ftemperatures than of late as showers
OL,14,For longer spells of rain move through,
OL,15,Finterspersed with brighter, drier
OL,16,Finterludes. Often breezy, with
OL,17,Foccasionally strong winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
